Version 3.0 - 2026-10-21
  * Added 13 new coins.
  * Added a website reference on UI.
  * Added an optional file with the user's own coins: ~/.ap6c.CoinModel.
    It uses the same format of CoinModel.qml and the coins are added to the end
    of the 'From Crypto' list.
  * Added Enabled option.
  * Added the Error Color option, used when 'Err' is displayed. Empty uses the
    theme's default error color.
  * Added the Horizontal Layout option: coin name (or pair) and price in a
    single line. Useful for small panels.
  * Added the Price Provider option: Binance (default) or Coinbase. Useful where
    Binance is blocked.
  * Added USD to the currency list (Coinbase only).
  * Blink Refresh is now enabled by default.
  * Created CI tests for GitHub.
  * Configuration window: default values now match the real defaults; removed
    circular bindings.
  * Fixed answers arriving out of order (a slow answer for the old coin could
    replace the new price).
  * Fixed duplicated requests: each refresh cycle was querying Binance twice.
  * Fixed the thousands separator being applied to decimal places (1,234.5,678)
    when using 4 or more decimal places.
  * Removed unused code.
  * Startup and pair changes now trigger a single request instead of up to
    three.
  * Updated README.md.

Version 2.4 - 2025-05-12
  * Added 36 new coins. Current total: 119 coins.
  * Added a timeout to declare lost connection, displaying ERR for this event.
  * Allowing up to 8 decimal places instead of 4 for Price Multiplier.
  * Updated README.md.

Version 2.3 - 2025-05-03
  * Added 8 new coins.
  * Added Price Multiplier option.
  * Added optional thousands separator.
  * Added optional swap commas-dots.
  * Added vertical scroll bar for configuration screen to be displayed when needed.
  * Added script check-top-100.sh to improve the searching for new coins.
  * Updated README.md.

Version 2.2 - 2025-04-30
  * Added a refresh time option. The value is between 1 and 60 minutes.
  * Added a blinking on price refresh option.
  * Updated README.md.

Version 2.1 - 2025-04-21
  * Increased delay of the click price update.
  * Implemented colors. Now, users can apply colors to prices.
  * Updated README.md.

Version 2.0 - 2025-04-19
  * Migrated from CoinGecko API to Binance API.
      -  Binance API is faster than CoinGecko API.
      -  Binance API has less limitations. It is possible to access several pairs of coins at the same time.
      -  In April 18, 2025, CoinGecko API was providing 100 coins under USD, while Binance had 573 under USDT.
  * Added 36 new coins and 10 new currencies.
  * Returning 'Err' on errors, in the price area.
  * Updating the price when clicking over it.

Version 1.2.1 - 2025-04-16
  * UNRELEASED.
  * Improved documentation.
  * The last version under CoinGecko. Migrating to Binance...

Version 1.2 - 2025-04-16
